; Original Brickwright CARDIAC example: the executed word changes.
; The source remains a draft; live memory is the execution authority.
ORG 10
ENTRY show
show:  OUT table
       CLA show
       ADD one
       STO show
       CLA remaining
       SUB one
       STO remaining
       TAC done
       JMP show
done:  HRS
ORG 80
table: DAT 11, 22, 33
ORG 90
one:       DAT 1
remaining: DAT 2
